          "source": "netlist",
          "quote": "(net (code \"59\") (name \"unconnected-(C12-Pad1)\") (class \"Default\") (node (ref \"C12\") (pin \"1\") (pintype \"passive\")))"
        }
      ],
      "impact": "C12 is electrically floating and provides no decoupling; the wrong footprint may also cause assembly issues.",
      "confidence": 0.95
    },
    {
      "category": "short_to_ground",
